overview=dict(status='usable',formation=path('The local leader flushes/batches proposals and sends AcceptDecide only after Prepare collected a read quorum and adopted maximum accepted-round/index history. Followers in the promised ballot and Accept phase append ordered traffic and reply Accepted. The leader counts distinct pid slots against a write quorum, persists the chosen decided index and sends Decide or piggybacks it. Followers flush as needed and expose decided entries through read APIs. Append admission itself is not completion.',['B-prepare-quorum','B-accept-decide','B-read','B-client'],['F-decided'],['S-formation','S-support','S-follower','S-read','S-api']),context=path('BLE heartbeat rounds select potential authority; try_become_leader is also public. SequencePaxos only acquires a strictly higher local ballot, persists its promise, clears leader support and requests promises. Receiving a higher Prepare flushes pending batches, persists promise and resets follower sequencing. Prior ballot accept/decide traffic is rejected; phase and session/counter checks protect ordered acceptance. Recovery starts from persisted promise and uses PrepareReq to allow equal-ballot Prepare. Reconfiguration replicates a terminal StopSign and leaves new instance startup/state transfer to callers.',['B-authority','B-recovery','B-membership'],['F-promise'],['S-election','S-leader','S-follower','S-follower-recovery','S-start','S-reconfig-contract']),connection=path('Promises report accepted round/index and decided boundary. The new leader selects the highest accepted history, retains the maximum reported decided boundary and synchronizes before admitting new formation. AcceptSync transfers the selected suffix or snapshot and starts a new per-follower sequence session; follower acknowledgment then feeds decision accounting in the leader ballot. Pending batches are flushed before promises, buffered proposals are appended after adoption unless a StopSign is present, or forwarded after follower sync. Established decisions constrain snapshot production and public reads, but correctness of delta base reconstruction remains an explicit local question.',['B-authority','B-prepare-quorum','B-sync-produce','B-sync-install','B-accept-decide'],['F-promise','F-delta','F-decided'],['S-leader','S-formation','S-follower','S-sync-producer','S-sync-consumer']),open_details=['Delta snapshot base reconstruction after decided-boundary update','Cross-configuration routing and ballot ordering/equality boundary','Runtime append identity correlation across leader changes','Compaction bookkeeping for non-contiguous participant ids and storage-failure recovery'],core_gaps=[],rationale='Representative formation, authority transition, old work, recovery, configuration and consumption paths have been traced. This is a navigation basis, not a coverage or correctness claim.')
